English summary (for reference only)

This project is a derivative fusion of three upstream projects and is
licensed as a whole under this non-commercial share license. You may view,
run, modify and share it for non-commercial purposes, provided you keep
this file, NOTICE.md and CREDITS.md, credit the upstream projects, and link
back to this repository. Commercial use of any kind — including selling,
paid licensing, and integration into commercial products or services — is
prohibited, and the spherical character visual designs may never be used
commercially. Upstream licenses continue to apply to their portions; where
this license conflicts with an upstream license, the stricter term governs.
